{"dimension": 384, "max_elements": 100000, "ef_construction": 200, "m": 16, "ef_search": 50, "max_entries": null, "eviction_batch_size": 100, "eviction_count": 0, "memory_to_hnsw": {"ed2c4cad-988f-4448-937f-fdc96e65e102": 0, "57b4346f-297d-4a29-8dcf-f75c8c3228ee": 1, "cde96da5-eda1-472c-8c5a-aa5bce739d11": 2, "1e60b7c6-c0eb-42de-8fc7-536723d62121": 3, "603287f2-a157-4c51-b5d8-b3c5ba4d2fc6": 4, "6bfeef57-f71f-4427-972f-b3f5a095439e": 5, "6d9cb469-f246-4f8e-bf5a-fb2f723c4302": 6, "a48ac2fe-75b4-43a8-954b-7e0db9bce2b3": 7, "78f1ee53-ec44-45ff-bcc5-19b13b9894c6": 8, "91f4dfe0-0be4-4192-9e95-7b42644db2a7": 9, "4c939cb5-e90f-4d3a-a876-ffcf66051761": 10, "4b322346-3af3-42f4-9119-e2d92260eeef": 11, "29f0ddc1-37aa-4c40-83c6-114b18503724": 12}, "hnsw_to_memory": {"0": "ed2c4cad-988f-4448-937f-fdc96e65e102", "1": "57b4346f-297d-4a29-8dcf-f75c8c3228ee", "2": "cde96da5-eda1-472c-8c5a-aa5bce739d11", "3": "1e60b7c6-c0eb-42de-8fc7-536723d62121", "4": "603287f2-a157-4c51-b5d8-b3c5ba4d2fc6", "5": "6bfeef57-f71f-4427-972f-b3f5a095439e", "6": "6d9cb469-f246-4f8e-bf5a-fb2f723c4302", "7": "a48ac2fe-75b4-43a8-954b-7e0db9bce2b3", "8": "78f1ee53-ec44-45ff-bcc5-19b13b9894c6", "9": "91f4dfe0-0be4-4192-9e95-7b42644db2a7", "10": "4c939cb5-e90f-4d3a-a876-ffcf66051761", "11": "4b322346-3af3-42f4-9119-e2d92260eeef", "12": "29f0ddc1-37aa-4c40-83c6-114b18503724"}, "next_hnsw_id": 13, "metadata": {"ed2c4cad-988f-4448-937f-fdc96e65e102": {"memory_id": "ed2c4cad-988f-4448-937f-fdc96e65e102", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "## Components Built (2026-07-14)\n\n### Animation Utilities Layer\n- **useAnimeJs.js** \u2014 Timeline management hook, pause/play/reset/seek controls, cleanup on unmount\n- **animationPatterns.js** \u2014 15+ reusable animation functions:\n  - `drawPath()` \u2014 SVG stroke-dasharray animations\n  - `pulseEffect()` \u2014 Emphasis pulse\n  - `radialBurst()` \u2014 Circular expand from center\n  - `countUpNumber()` \u2014 Number count-up with formatting\n  - `colorWave()` \u2014 Cascading color change\n  - `gearRotation()` \u2014 Spinning with optional scale\n  - `svgZoom()` \u2014 ViewBox smooth transition\n  - `morphShape()` \u2014 Path morphing\n  - `flipInStagger()` \u2014 Cards flip-in effect\n  - `floating()` \u2014 Bobbing animation loop\n  - `followPath()` \u2014 Element follows SVG path\n  - `gridPattern()` \u2014 Grid/matrix reveal (spiral, wave, diagonal, random patterns)\n\n### Major Components\n\n#### 1. EnergyUsageScalingAnimation\n**Location:** `presentation-japan/src/components/EnergyUsageScalingAnimation.jsx`\n\n3-phase scaling animation: 1 home \u2192 9-building cluster \u2192 25-building city grid\n- Phase 1 (0-3s): Single home with energy pulse\n- Phase 2 (3-7s): Transform to building cluster, larger wave\n- Phase 3 (7-12s): City-scale grid with massive wave\n- Includes decorative grid background\n- Built-in info overlay showing current scale\n\n**Reusability:** Drop-in component, `autoPlay` prop controls playback, can be stepped via props\n\n#### 2. JapanGridMapAnimated\n**Location:** `presentation-japan/src/components/JapanGridMapAnimated.jsx`\n\nStep-based map animation (8 steps) showing Japan grid structure:\n- Step 0: Japan island outline\n- Step 1-2: 50Hz utilities (east) + 60Hz utilities (west) with region network paths\n- Step 3: Frequency dividing line with labels (1.2 GW capacity bottleneck)\n- Step 4: LNG terminals + import flow + pulsing indicators\n- Step 5: Hormuz strait indicator + route animation\n- Step 6: Stat boxes with count-up (15.3%, 70%)\n- Step 7: 50/60Hz seam sidebar annotation\n\n**Reusability:** `step` prop drives animation sequence, can be integrated with StepBridge\n\n#### 3. DataCenterMapOverlay\n**Location:** `presentation-japan/src/components/DataCenterMapOverlay.jsx`\n\nMap + demand forecast dual-view component:\n- LEFT: Map showing 5 planned data centers (Tokyo, Kanto, Kansai, Kyushu, Tohoku)\n- RIGHT: Mini demand forecast chart (2024: 19 TWh \u2192 2028: 35 TWh \u2192 2034: 57 TWh)\n- Status indicators: delayed (red) vs planning (amber)\n- Optional stress zone visualization showing grid impact radius\n- Stress lines connecting data centers to utilities\n\n**Reusability:** `showStress` prop toggles stress visualization, can auto-play or be stepped\n\n#### 4. AnimatedStatBox\n**Location:** `presentation-japan/src/components/AnimatedStatBox.jsx`\n\nReusable stat box component with:\n- Entrance animation (fade + slide)\n- Count-up number animation\n- Optional pulse effect on complete\n- Configurable color, delay, direction\n- Format options (percentage, integer, decimal)\n\n**Reusability:** Used throughout keynote for any stat display\n\n#### 5. ExplanationBox\n**Location:** `presentation-japan/src/components/ExplanationBox.jsx`\n\nReusable explanation component with:\n- Title + icon + stat + description layout\n- Directional entrance (up/down/left/right)\n- Underline animation on title\n- 4 presets: SELF_SUFFICIENCY, FOSSIL_FUEL, GRID_ISOLATION, LNG_IMPORT\n\n**Reusability:** Used for \"what does 15.3% mean?\" style callouts\n\n### Stagger Patterns (DRY)\nAll components use STAGGER_PATTERNS from hook:\n- LINEAR: `i * 50`\n- EXPONENTIAL: `Math.pow(i, 1.5) * 30`\n- WAVE: `Math.sin(i * 0.5) * 100 + i * 20`\n- FIBONACCI: Uses sequence\n- RANDOM: `Math.random() * 300`\n\n### Color System (DRY)\nAll animations use CSS vars + preset colors:\n- Cyan: #22d3ee (50Hz, tech)\n- Green: #10b981 (60Hz, west, healthy)\n- Amber: #FFC217 (data centers, warning)\n- Orange: #FFA35F (Hormuz, escalation)\n- Red: #ef4444 (crisis, delayed)\n- Blue: #3939D8 (grid, infrastructure)\n\n## Still Needed for Keynote\n\n1. **JEPX Pattern Slide** \u2014 Enhanced 2021 spike visualization with scaling animation (home \u2192 building \u2192 city affected by spike)\n2. **Integration with Keynote.jsx** \u2014 Wire up new components to slides\n3. **Update slide structure** \u2014 Restructure from current 22 slides to ~24-26 with expanded opening\n4. **Context compression hook** \u2014 Add to AGENTS.md\n\n## Design Principles Applied\n\n- **DRY:** Stagger patterns, colors, animation utilities centralized\n- **Composable:** Mix-and-match animations via `animationPatterns.js`\n- **Flexible:** All components accept options (autoPlay, step, color, delay, direction)\n- **Timeline-based:** All use anime.js timeline for sync control\n- **Performance:** LazyContent pattern from existing codebase ensures renders only on active slides\n- **Consistent:** All use same font families, spacing, color system", "created_at": "2026-07-14T14:16:37.752459", "importance": 0.6, "metadata": {"source_agent": "claude", "source_file": "animation_components_created.md", "content_hash": "299a4fe3db05a6c4", "synced_at": "2026-07-14T14:16:37.752186+00:00", "sync_direction": "import", "name": "animation-components-built", "description": "Keynote animation components for Japan presentation - reusable, DRY animation utilities and components", "headroom_id": ""}}, "57b4346f-297d-4a29-8dcf-f75c8c3228ee": {"memory_id": "57b4346f-297d-4a29-8dcf-f75c8c3228ee", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": ["Keynote.jsx", "presentation-japan", "anime.js", "Japan", "claude.md", "agents.md"], "content": "Reference screenshot: ~/Desktop/Screenshot 2026-07-14 at 01.11.01", "created_at": "2026-07-13T23:17:09.677331", "importance": 0.95, "metadata": {"source_agent": "claude", "source_provider": "anthropic", "created_via": "tool_call", "created_at_utc": "2026-07-13T23:17:08.139318+00:00", "workspace_display": "unresolved (no memory)", "workspace_key": "", "storage_mode": "project", "_pre_extracted": true, "_fact_count": 9, "_fact_index": 8}}, "cde96da5-eda1-472c-8c5a-aa5bce739d11": {"memory_id": "cde96da5-eda1-472c-8c5a-aa5bce739d11", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": ["Keynote.jsx", "presentation-japan", "anime.js", "Japan", "claude.md", "agents.md"], "content": "Reference animations: https://codepen.io/juliangarnier/pen/ZYEwYBo and https://codepen.io/juliangarnier/pen/GgRzgqp", "created_at": "2026-07-13T23:17:09.649970", "importance": 0.95, "metadata": {"source_agent": "claude", "source_provider": "anthropic", "created_via": "tool_call", "created_at_utc": "2026-07-13T23:17:08.139318+00:00", "workspace_display": "unresolved (no memory)", "workspace_key": "", "storage_mode": "project", "_pre_extracted": true, "_fact_count": 9, "_fact_index": 7}}, "1e60b7c6-c0eb-42de-8fc7-536723d62121": {"memory_id": "1e60b7c6-c0eb-42de-8fc7-536723d62121", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": ["Keynote.jsx", "presentation-japan", "anime.js", "Japan", "claude.md", "agents.md"], "content": "Animation library: anime.js with staggering, transforms, SVG manipulations", "created_at": "2026-07-13T23:17:09.637752", "importance": 0.95, "metadata": {"source_agent": "claude", "source_provider": "anthropic", "created_via": "tool_call", "created_at_utc": "2026-07-13T23:17:08.139318+00:00", "workspace_display": "unresolved (no memory)", "workspace_key": "", "storage_mode": "project", "_pre_extracted": true, "_fact_count": 9, "_fact_index": 6}}, "603287f2-a157-4c51-b5d8-b3c5ba4d2fc6": {"memory_id": "603287f2-a157-4c51-b5d8-b3c5ba4d2fc6", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": ["Keynote.jsx", "presentation-japan", "anime.js", "Japan", "claude.md", "agents.md"], "content": "VPP: Japan-specific numbers and imagery", "created_at": "2026-07-13T23:17:09.323876", "importance": 0.95, "metadata": {"source_agent": "claude", "source_provider": "anthropic", "created_via": "tool_call", "created_at_utc": "2026-07-13T23:17:08.139318+00:00", "workspace_display": "unresolved (no memory)", "workspace_key": "", "storage_mode": "project", "_pre_extracted": true, "_fact_count": 9, "_fact_index": 5}}, "6bfeef57-f71f-4427-972f-b3f5a095439e": {"memory_id": "6bfeef57-f71f-4427-972f-b3f5a095439e", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": ["Keynote.jsx", "presentation-japan", "anime.js", "Japan", "claude.md", "agents.md"], "content": "Data centers: show locations on map with grid stress and load graph", "created_at": "2026-07-13T23:17:09.005889", "importance": 0.95, "metadata": {"source_agent": "claude", "source_provider": "anthropic", "created_via": "tool_call", "created_at_utc": "2026-07-13T23:17:08.139318+00:00", "workspace_display": "unresolved (no memory)", "workspace_key": "", "storage_mode": "project", "_pre_extracted": true, "_fact_count": 9, "_fact_index": 4}}, "6d9cb469-f246-4f8e-bf5a-fb2f723c4302": {"memory_id": "6d9cb469-f246-4f8e-bf5a-fb2f723c4302", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": ["Keynote.jsx", "presentation-japan", "anime.js", "Japan", "claude.md", "agents.md"], "content": "Includes 2022 power emergency context", "created_at": "2026-07-13T23:17:08.605330", "importance": 0.95, "metadata": {"source_agent": "claude", "source_provider": "anthropic", "created_via": "tool_call", "created_at_utc": "2026-07-13T23:17:08.139318+00:00", "workspace_display": "unresolved (no memory)", "workspace_key": "", "storage_mode": "project", "_pre_extracted": true, "_fact_count": 9, "_fact_index": 3}}, "a48ac2fe-75b4-43a8-954b-7e0db9bce2b3": {"memory_id": "a48ac2fe-75b4-43a8-954b-7e0db9bce2b3", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": ["Keynote.jsx", "presentation-japan", "anime.js", "Japan", "claude.md", "agents.md"], "content": "Pattern slide: 2021 spike at 251 JPY/kWh, scaling animation (home to apartment to city)", "created_at": "2026-07-13T23:17:08.438899", "importance": 0.95, "metadata": {"source_agent": "claude", "source_provider": "anthropic", "created_via": "tool_call", "created_at_utc": "2026-07-13T23:17:08.139318+00:00", "workspace_display": "unresolved (no memory)", "workspace_key": "", "storage_mode": "project", "_pre_extracted": true, "_fact_count": 9, "_fact_index": 2}}, "78f1ee53-ec44-45ff-bcc5-19b13b9894c6": {"memory_id": "78f1ee53-ec44-45ff-bcc5-19b13b9894c6", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": ["Keynote.jsx", "presentation-japan", "anime.js", "Japan", "claude.md", "agents.md"], "content": "Slide 1 features: full-size map, Japanese grid with island connections, 15.3% self-sufficiency, 70% fossil fuel dependency, LNG connections, Strait of Hormuz", "created_at": "2026-07-13T23:17:08.324144", "importance": 0.95, "metadata": {"source_agent": "claude", "source_provider": "anthropic", "created_via": "tool_call", "created_at_utc": "2026-07-13T23:17:08.139318+00:00", "workspace_display": "unresolved (no memory)", "workspace_key": "", "storage_mode": "project", "_pre_extracted": true, "_fact_count": 9, "_fact_index": 1}}, "91f4dfe0-0be4-4192-9e95-7b42644db2a7": {"memory_id": "91f4dfe0-0be4-4192-9e95-7b42644db2a7", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": ["Keynote.jsx", "presentation-japan", "anime.js", "Japan", "claude.md", "agents.md"], "content": "Title slide text: 'The Energy Grid Is Becoming a Cloud Native Distributed System'", "created_at": "2026-07-13T23:17:08.142043", "importance": 0.95, "metadata": {"source_agent": "claude", "source_provider": "anthropic", "created_via": "tool_call", "created_at_utc": "2026-07-13T23:17:08.139318+00:00", "workspace_display": "unresolved (no memory)", "workspace_key": "", "storage_mode": "project", "_pre_extracted": true, "_fact_count": 9, "_fact_index": 0}}, "4c939cb5-e90f-4d3a-a876-ffcf66051761": {"memory_id": "4c939cb5-e90f-4d3a-a876-ffcf66051761", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "Two new presentations for KubeCon Japan 2026 (Yokohama), colocated in `presentation-japan/` directory.\n\n## Deliverables\n1. **Keynote** \u2014 solo talk (~22 slides), LeRenzo only\n2. **Main conference talk** \u2014 co-presented by LeRenzo Malcolm + Priyanka (~33 slides, same structure as Amsterdam KubeCon EU talk)\n\n## Keynote structure\n- **Opening hook**: Strait of Hormuz closure (Feb/Mar 2026) \u2192 every household in Japan paying +\u00a515,000/year from April 2026. Audience is living it right now.\n- Japan's structural fragility: 15.3% self-sufficiency, 70% fossil fuel, island grid\n- Pattern of crises: Jan 2021 JEPX spike (10\u2192251 JPY/kWh, 25x, no disaster), March 2022 first-ever power supply warning (TEPCO reserve 2.5%)\n- The accelerant: data center demand 19\u219257 TWh by 2034, 40+ projects delayed in 2024\n- VPP as distributed system architecture (Dapr Actors, CQRS, Kafka/MQTT/EMQX, ArgoCD, Spark, OTel)\n- Closing: 100,000 homes coordinated by software = one power plant\n\n## Main talk act structure\n- Act 1 THE GRID \u2192 fully replaced with Japan-specific content (50/60Hz split, island isolation, JEPX 2021 spike, 15.3% stat)\n- Act 2 RENEWABLES \u2192 Japan-specific: Kyushu curtailment spreading to Tokyo (March 2026), Shizen Connect EV VPP, HEMS battery demos\n- Act 3 VPP \u2192 Same architecture, add ERAB regulatory layer, Japan VPP map (Kansai/Kyushu area)\n\n## Typography (finalized)\n- Headings/titles: **Space Grotesk**\n- Body/narrative: **Inter**\n- Data labels, HUD overlays: **JetBrains Mono** (unchanged)\n\n## Theme adaptation (finalized)\n- See `docs/planning/JapanKubeCon.pen` for palette comparison, slide mockups, font exploration, light theme variants, hybrid concept, final decisions\n- Ship order: dark first \u2192 light (phase 2) \u2192 hybrid (phase 3)\n- Toggle: `?theme=dark|light|hybrid` URL param + localStorage + UI button in slide chrome\n- Dark: background `#060a1a`, headings `#3939D8`, data viz `#22d3ee`, accent `#FFC217`, warm `#FFA35F`\n- Light: background `#EEF2FF`, title text `#1D1D6B`, accents `#3939D8`\n- Hybrid: light on narrative/text slides, dark on all viz/map/chart slides (per-slide `theme` prop)\n- i18n toggle uses same URL param + localStorage pattern: `?lang=en|ja`, build UI once, add JA strings as follow-up\n\n## New visualizations needed\n- `JEPXPriceChart` \u2014 2021 spike (10\u2192251 JPY/kWh over 40 days)\n- `JapanGridMap` \u2014 10 regional utilities, 50/60Hz seam, HVDC links\n- `JapanSelfSufficiency` \u2014 G7 bar chart, Japan at 15.3%\n- `KyushuCurtailmentChart` \u2014 spreading to Tokyo 2026\n- `JapanDemandForecast` \u2014 data center 19\u219257 TWh curve\n- `JapanVPPMap` \u2014 Kansai/Kyushu scenario (like SAMapHUD)\n\n## Website additions\n- `/research/incidents/2021-japan-jepx-price-spike`\n- `/research/incidents/2022-japan-power-supply-warning`\n- `/research/topics/japan-energy-fragility`\n- `/research/topics/kyushu-solar-curtailment`\n- Japan section on homepage + links to both Japan decks\n\n## Post-presentation backlog (not urgent)\n- Website i18n/localization (Astro i18next, EN + JA)\n- Color palette swapping via CSS custom properties (mission-control, japan, high-contrast themes)\n\n**Why:** KubeCon Japan 2026 is in Yokohama. The Hormuz crisis (March 2026) makes Japan's energy fragility a live, present-tense issue for the audience.\n**How to apply:** When implementing, create `presentation-japan/` at root level parallel to `presentation/`. Share components from `presentation/src/components/` \u2014 don't duplicate them.", "created_at": "2026-06-29T11:21:47.476041", "importance": 0.6, "metadata": {"source_agent": "claude", "source_file": "project_japan_presentations.md", "content_hash": "c840e45aebe2609b", "synced_at": "2026-06-29T11:21:47.475811+00:00", "sync_direction": "import", "name": "project-japan-presentations", "description": "KubeCon Japan 2026 presentations \u2014 scope, structure, speakers, design decisions", "headroom_id": ""}}, "4b322346-3af3-42f4-9119-e2d92260eeef": {"memory_id": "4b322346-3af3-42f4-9119-e2d92260eeef", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "Japan keynote rendering fix (2026-07-21): presentation-japan Keynote.jsx must not wrap components that use Spectacle useSteps in LazyContent, because it deregisters their step state and yields blank slides. StepBridge normalizes Spectacle's 1-based step to zero-based: Math.max(0, (rawStep ?? 1) - 1). Regression test is presentation-japan/tests/keynote-rendering.cjs and requires the Vite dev server on localhost:3100.", "created_at": "2026-07-21T19:43:22.264516", "importance": 0.7, "metadata": {}}, "29f0ddc1-37aa-4c40-83c6-114b18503724": {"memory_id": "29f0ddc1-37aa-4c40-83c6-114b18503724", "user_id": "lerenzomalcom", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "On 2026-07-21 user approved replacing screen-coordinate SVG map overlays in the keynote Hormuz sequence with geospatial Deck.gl layers over the existing MapLibre basemap, rather than embedding Kepler.gl. Rationale: Deck.gl retains precise, deterministic presenter-driven camera choreography inside Spectacle without Kepler.gl's exploratory application shell. All utility, frequency seam, terminal, Hormuz, import-flow, route, pulse, and label marks must be longitude/latitude anchored.", "created_at": "2026-07-21T20:25:02.121247", "importance": 0.7, "metadata": {}}}, "embeddings": {"ed2c4cad-988f-4448-937f-fdc96e65e102": [-0.08002462238073349, -0.041573233902454376, -0.0042081777937710285, -0.023888256400823593, -0.010701603256165981, 0.03952842205762863, -0.004954173229634762, -0.021682310849428177, 0.06497372686862946, -0.08896695822477341, -0.011002549901604652, 0.019780540838837624, -0.1050107404589653, -0.03753790259361267, 0.03142527863383293, -0.004799355287104845, -0.06522149592638016, 0.0046563283540308475, -0.014022047631442547, -0.03290841728448868